  only UTC-Z certificate timestamps, including the exact transitive artifact
  closure used to validate the manifest digest.
- T6 persisted one immutable S42 through the existing Reauthorize owner for every
  independently varied finite dependency, including exact authoritative start/end
  entries and a deterministic digest.
- Future-effective manifest, evidence-resolution, validation, and projection rows
  denied before issuance.
- A deliberately incomplete certificate was rejected after attempted S39-S43,
