  named state rolled back atomically.
- T7 database evidence exercised HOLD, STOP, RESTRICTION, and unprovable control
  projection states.
- The E2E used canonical trusted-admin TEST registration, its exact isolated
  policy/environment, TEST_ONLY S42 scope, and a bound TEST-principal lookup before
  calling the non-bearer evaluator boundary. A committed transitive revoke changed
